# ==============================================================================
# GitHub Linguist Configuration for Sorayunara
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Primary Language: Sorayunara (.sora)
# Map syntax highlighting to Rust for GitHub web interface rendering
*.sora linguist-language=Rust
*.sora linguist-detectable=true

# 2. Build outputs & generated caches
target/** linguist-vendored
output.* linguist-generated
*.lock linguist-generated

# 3. Documentation
docs/** linguist-documentation
*.md linguist-documentation
